SUMMARY:AVLH3 #871 - Worst $8 Trail Ever
DESCRIPTION:Asheville Hash House Harriers (AVLH3)\n**WHERE**: River Hills 
 Shopping Center\n\n**WHEN**: Saturday\, Oct 3 - 2pm gather/ 2:15pm Hare aw
 ay\n\n**HARE**: Captain Bangaroo\n\n**HASH CASH**: $8\n\n**SHIGGY LEVE**L:
