BEGIN:VEVENT
X-SOURCE-URLS:{"Ncarboretum": "https://ncarboretum.org/event/fall-garden-photography-workshop/"}
X-SOURCE-ID:ncarboretum
X-SOURCE:NC Arboretum
DTSTART;TZID=America/New_York:20261007T100000
DTEND;TZID=America/New_York:20261007T120000
DTSTAMP:20260818T134706Z
CREATED:20260818T134706Z
LAST-MODIFIED:20260818T134706Z
UID:1778780019768-1791367200-1791374400@ncarboretum.org
SUMMARY:Fall Garden Photography Workshop
DESCRIPTION:Fall Garden Photography Workshop\nwith Cami Calnan \nWednesday\, October 7  |  10am – 12pm \nRegister Here!\n  \nDo you want to learn to take better seasonal fall photos in the gardens? Join us for a hands-on workshop where we use whatever camera you are working with to learn tips\, tricks\, and techniques to take the photos you are hoping to capture. Bring your phone\, a point and shoot camera\, digital SLR or film SLR camera. This class is for all levels of photographers. \nThis program will take place outside and will follow easy trails and paved walkways. Dress for the weather and prepare to be outside for the entire program time. \nCamilla Calnan is an Asheville based photographer since 2000 and has been a longtime friend and supporter of the NC Arboretum. She works to support the community and region through her photography\, capturing the uniqueness that makes the Asheville area what it is. Tirelessly working to photograph nature\, landscape\, portrait\, event\, wedding\, commercial/corporate\, product\, farm\, food\, restaurant\, individual\, and family photos\, Camilla strives to fill the everchanging needs of our community. \n●  Members: Remember to enter your promo code upon checkout to receive your 10% member discount! Email adulteducation@ncarboretum.org with questions. \n●  See a full listing of Adult Education Programs at the North Carolina Arboretum here! Questions? Check our FAQs. \n●  We are committed to fostering a diverse\, supportive learning community. If the cost of a class is a barrier for you\, please complete this scholarship form and we will see what kind of assistance we can provide. \n●  Follow us on Facebook & Instagram! \n●  Join our Adult Education Student Hub on Discord! \n●  Interested in supporting the NC Arboretum more directly? Donate to the ONE Fund here. \nSee all of our classes open for registration here!
URL:https://ncarboretum.org/event/fall-garden-photography-workshop/
CATEGORIES:Adult Education
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/png:https://ncarboretum.org/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/AdventurePhotogrpahy.png
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
