SUMMARY:AMC Friday Ecstatic Dance LIVE Music w/ Alexander Caruso and Frien
 ds
DESCRIPTION:Asheville Movement Collective\nSunday\, October 11th\n1st Danc
 e Wave 8:30\\-10:30am \\| Warmup 8:30am \\| Opening Circle 9am\n2nd Dance 
 Wave 10:30\\-12:30am \\| Warmup 10:30am \\| Opening Circle 11am\nLIVE Musi
 c w/ Alexander Caruso and Friends \\| Support Facilitator: TBA\n\nIntentio
 n: TBA\n\nAbout the Musicians:\nYou can find more information about Alexan
 der Caruso\, including music\, at [https://www.alexandercaruso.com](https:
 //www.alexandercaruso.com).\n\n\\~\\~\\~\n\n\\*\\* Please note that the da
 nce starts at Warm up. The doors close promptly at Opening Circle and any 
 that come late will be turned away. Please be on time to ensure a safe and
  secure container. \\*\\*\nTicket Prices: $25-50 or name your price.\nNo o
 ne turned away for lack of funds!\n\nPre-registration Recommended:\n[https
 ://ashevillemovementcollective.org/event/live-music-20260911/](https://ash
 evillemovementcollective.org/event/live-music-20260911/)\n\nVOLUNTEER!\n\n
 We need volunteers. Volunteer and dance for free! Register to volunteer at
 :\n[https://ashevillemovementcollective.org/volunteer/](https://ashevillem
 ovementcollective.org/volunteer/?fbclid=IwZXh0bgNhZW0CMTAAYnJpZBExMFZWQ0Zz
 TmFlam10YUN0RXNydGMGYXBwX2lkEDIyMjAzOTE3ODgyMDA4OTIAAR4XGdFINP8qUH1XAETf8I
 71UKxgUcbNb_LMLwgnJWEzr2I_3ELhDttUv2i1OA_aem_nrjKIXdVB1pootRUE4YAfA)\nIMPO
 RTANT ANNOUNCEMENTS:\n\nDoor will close at the beginning of the opening ci
 rcle. Please note: NO ENTRY AFTER OPENING CIRCLE BOTH WAVES!\n\nCollective
  agreements:\n[https://ashevillemovementcollective.org/our-dance/](https:/
 /ashevillemovementcollective.org/our-dance/?fbclid=IwZXh0bgNhZW0CMTAAYnJpZ
 BExMFZWQ0ZzTmFlam10YUN0RXNydGMGYXBwX2lkEDIyMjAzOTE3ODgyMDA4OTIAAR4XGdFINP8
 qUH1XAETf8I71UKxgUcbNb_LMLwgnJWEzr2I_3ELhDttUv2i1OA_aem_nrjKIXdVB1pootRUE4
 YAfA)\n\nAbout AMC:\nAsheville Movement Collective envisions a world that 
 moves in harmony where all are free to be their authentic selves within a 
 loving community. Our mission and aim are to inspire authenticity and heal
 thy community through free-form dance by hosting dance waves for personal 
 and community transformation. AMC is a 501(c)(3) nonprofit organization.\n
 \nLocation: 50 Bell Rd\, Asheville\, NC 28805\n\nSee you on the dance floo
 r!
