SUMMARY:Ecstatic Dance Wave w/ Sara Bensman
DESCRIPTION:Asheville Movement Collective\nFriday\, October 16th\nEvening 
 Dance Wave 7:00 pm \\- 9:00 pm \\| Warmup 7pm \\| Opening Circle 7:30pm\nF
 acilitator Sara Bensman\n\nIntention: TBA\n\n## About Sara Bensman\n\nSara
 ’s mix-making arises from musical exploration. She seeks to understand e
 nergy through somatic responses to sonic vibrations. Her facilitation is p
 ropelled by a desire to help build and sustain community by creating a saf
 e\, loving container for self-expression\, connection and release. If you
 ’d like to listen to her sets visit [https://soundcloud.com/sara-bensman
 ](https://soundcloud.com/sara-bensman)\n\n\\~\\~\\~\n\n\\*\\* Please note 
 that the dance starts at Warm up. The doors close promptly at Opening Circ
 le and any that come late will be turned away. Please be on time to ensure
  a safe and secure container. \\*\\*\nTicket Prices: $15 - $30 or name you
 r price.\n\nNo one turned away for lack of funds!\nPre-registration Recomm
 ended:\n\nVOLUNTEER!\n\nWe need volunteers. Volunteer and dance for free! 
 Register to volunteer at:\n[https://ashevillemovementcollective.org/volunt
 eer/](https://ashevillemovementcollective.org/volunteer/?fbclid=IwZXh0bgNh
 ZW0CMTAAYnJpZBExMFZWQ0ZzTmFlam10YUN0RXNydGMGYXBwX2lkEDIyMjAzOTE3ODgyMDA4OT
 IAAR4XGdFINP8qUH1XAETf8I71UKxgUcbNb_LMLwgnJWEzr2I_3ELhDttUv2i1OA_aem_nrjKI
 XdVB1pootRUE4YAfA)\n\nIMPORTANT ANNOUNCEMENTS:\n\nDoor will close at the b
 eginning of the opening circle. Please note: NO ENTRY AFTER OPENING CIRCLE
  BOTH WAVES!\n\nCollective agreements:\n[https://ashevillemovementcollecti
 ve.org/our-dance/](https://ashevillemovementcollective.org/our-dance/?fbcl
 id=IwZXh0bgNhZW0CMTAAYnJpZBExMFZWQ0ZzTmFlam10YUN0RXNydGMGYXBwX2lkEDIyMjAzO
 TE3ODgyMDA4OTIAAR4XGdFINP8qUH1XAETf8I71UKxgUcbNb_LMLwgnJWEzr2I_3ELhDttUv2i
 1OA_aem_nrjKIXdVB1pootRUE4YAfA)\n\nAbout AMC:\nAsheville Movement Collecti
 ve envisions a world that moves in harmony where all are free to be their 
 authentic selves within a loving community. Our mission and aim are to ins
 pire authenticity and healthy community through free-form dance by hosting
  dance waves for personal and community transformation. AMC is a 501(c)(3)
  nonprofit organization.\n\nLocation: 50 Bell Rd\, Asheville\, NC 28805\n\
 nSee you on the dance floor!
