 , Alt-Country\, Piedmont Blues\, Swing\, Appalachian\, &amp\; Bluegrass mu
 sic into a uniquely timeless sound. \n\n\n\nHarnessing her rolling contral
 to voice which scales over homespun finger-picked guitar\, her sound is wa
 rm\, rich\, and passionate—with songs that embrace and captivate listene
