X-SOURCE-ID:highlandbrewing
X-SOURCE:Highland Brewing, Where Y'at AVL Music
DTSTART;TZID=America/New_York:20261017T190000
DTEND;TZID=America/New_York:20261017T210000
DTSTAMP:20260913T174241Z
CREATED:20260913T174241Z
LAST-MODIFIED:20260913T174241Z
UID:10029847-1792263600-1792270800@highlandbrewing.com
SUMMARY:Pleasure Chest
DESCRIPTION:Pleasure Chest is a band that plays Blues\, Soul and Rock and Roll from Asheville\, North Carolina\n\n\n\n\n\n\nWeekend Live Music\nHighland Brewing’s weekend live music series showcases incredible local talent\, regional acts and national touring bands from across the East Coast and beyond. Free and open to all ages (unless noted otherwise)\, it’s the perfect excuse to gather your crew\, listen and vibe to a wide range of genres including soul\, bluegrass\, acoustic\, country\, folk and more.\nLive music typically takes place on our scenic Meadow stage. Shows are rain or shine\, if the weather doesn’t cooperate and we have time to move inside\, the band will play in the Taproom where there’s still plenty of room to boogie.\nChairs\, blankets and well-behaved\, leashed pets are welcome in the Meadow. Please note that coolers and outside alcohol are not permitted on the premises.
URL:https://highlandbrewing.com/calendar/pleasure-chest-2/
LOCATION:Meadow at Highland Brewing Co.\, 12 Old Charlotte Highway\, Suite 200\, Asheville\, NC\, 28803\, United States
CATEGORIES:Live Music
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/jpeg:https://highlandbrewing.com/wp-content/uploads/pleasurechest.jpeg
END:VEVENT
