SUMMARY:The Rocky Horror Picture Show w/Live Shadowcast
DESCRIPTION:A Special Tribute to Tim Curry!\nThe Unexpected Pleasures Troupe comes to The Mule! \nLet’s do the Time Warp again!  \nJoin us for a wild night as The Mule at Devil’s Foot Beverage Company present a screening of The Rocky Horror Picture Show with live shadowcast performance by Unexpected Pleasures RHPS Troupe! This will be a tribute to Tim Curry and the troupe encourages guests to dress as their favorite Tim Curry character.  \nSaturday October 17\, 2026 \nShow at 8 PM (doors at 7:30PM) \nThe Mule at Devil’s Foot Beverage Co. \n131 Sweeten Creek Rd\, Asheville\, NC 28803 \nDress up in your most outrageous RHPS costumes and bring all the call-backs you know and love. The Unexpected Pleasures cast will bring the film to life with their electrifying shadow cast performance\, so don’t just dream it…be it! \n Tickets on sale now!
URL:https://devilsfootbrew.com/event-detail/the-rocky-horror-picture-show-w-live-shadowcast-5/
CATEGORIES:Hosting with Friends
