SUMMARY:Midday Mingle at Twisted Laurel
DTSTART;TZID=America/New_York:20261021T120000
DTEND;TZID=America/New_York:20261021T133000
UID:a368c8474915bff8cb821b04b9219a02@ashevillechamber.org
DESCRIPTION:Join the Asheville Chamber for Midday Mingle hosted by Twisted
  Laurel in downtown Asheville. Take a midday break to enjoy a delicious lu
 nch\, connect with fellow Chamber members\, and build valuable relationshi
 ps -- all in a relaxed and friendly setting. Whether you’re new to the C
