SUMMARY:Crafting Variance
DTSTART;TZID=America/New_York:20261022T100000
DTEND;TZID=America/New_York:20261022T180000
UID:0dba0b9b2f5054fe9792b75e748c871a@asheville.com
DESCRIPTION:Recurring daily until Saturday\, May 1\, 2027. What does it me
 an to know and work with a material\, and what happens when makers embrace
  variability? Crafting Variance\, a new exhibition opening at the Center f
