DTSTART;TZID=America/New_York:20261022T180000
DTEND;TZID=America/New_York:20261022T200000
SUMMARY:Thursday Run 
DESCRIPTION:Asheville Runners\nCome run 1\, 3\, or 6 miles and stay for a 
 beer and soccer tennis after at Olde London Road.\n\nRoutes-\n1 miler:\nRI
 GHT out of OLR parking lot\nContinue around roundabout at Clingman\, and h
 ead toward the river on Lyman St.\nRIGHT on River Arts Place\nCross Rivers
 ide onto the Greenway\nRight on the Greenway to the Craven St Park put in 
 (the dock)\nTurn around and go back the same way to OLR\n\n3 miler:\nStart
  the same as 1 miler\nContinue onto Craven St. Bridge\nLEFT onto Greenway 
 after bridge\nFollow Greenway all the way until it ends at Haywood Rd.\nRI
 GHT onto Haywood Rd\, go across the bridge\nCross the Roundabout at Robert
 s St. and continue onto Clingman\nContinue on Clingman\nLEFT onto Owens Be
 ll Lane\nLEFT onto Hilliard at the top of the hill\nLEFT onto W Haywood\, 
 follow all the way down to Roberts\nLEFT onto Roberts\nFollow Roberts back
  to OLR\nPass OLR to Bartlett\, turn around and come back to OLR\n\n6 mile
 r:\nAfter the W Haywood downhill to Roberts\nLEFT onto Roberts St. take to
  Lyman and head back to the Greenway\nLEFT onto the Greenway\, take all th
 e way to Amboy\nRIGHT on Amboy to cross the bridge\nRIGHT into French Broa
 d River Park\, run the loop at the park\nCross back over the bridge on Amb
 oy and run the Greenway back to the roundabout\nFollow Lyman back to OLR
URL;VALUE=URI:https://www.meetup.com/asheville-runners/events/316819193/
STATUS:CONFIRMED
CREATED:20261002T222115Z
LAST-MODIFIED:20261002T222115Z
CLASS:PUBLIC
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
X-SOURCE-URLS:{"Meetup Avl Digital Nomads": "https://www.meetup.com/avl-digital-nomads/events/315607948/"}
X-SOURCE-ID:meetup_avl_digital_nomads
X-SOURCE:AVL Digital Nomads
UID:event_315607948@meetup.com
SEQUENCE:1
DTSTAMP:20261003T050020Z
DTSTART;TZID=America/New_York:20261022T180000
DTEND;TZID=America/New_York:20261022T195000
SUMMARY:Manifesting Self
DESCRIPTION:AVL Digital Nomads\n**Location Change:**\n**Disclaimer: In all
  efforts to keep this Meetup a safe space\, we all agree to keep anything 
 said within the group private and confidential.**\n\nDo you want to take y
 our remote working game to the next level? Do you find yourself saying wtf
  is Manifesting Self??\n\nWell\, you’re not alone. Remote working is gla
 morous\, and also presents itself with challenges not seen in the traditio
 nal office environment.\n\nManifesting Self may sound a little out there. 
 Trust me. It’s not. Whether we’ve been in the remote space for years\,
  since the pandemic\, or just recently\, I’m certain it has changed each
  of us in ways we never thought possible. Let’s explore that together. T
 he highs\, the lows\, and everywhere in between. And from there experience
  growth.\n\nWe are so excited to see you\, again or for the first time!
URL;VALUE=URI:https://www.meetup.com/avl-digital-nomads/events/315607948/
STATUS:CONFIRMED
CREATED:20260709T005310Z
LAST-MODIFIED:20260709T005310Z
CLASS:PUBLIC
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
X-SOURCE-URLS:{"Meetup Avl Digital Nomads": "https://www.meetup.com/avl-digital-nomads/events/316812475/"}
X-SOURCE-ID:meetup_avl_digital_nomads
X-SOURCE:AVL Digital Nomads
UID:event_316812475@meetup.com
SEQUENCE:1
DTSTAMP:20261003T050020Z
DTSTART;TZID=America/New_York:20261022T180000
DTEND;TZID=America/New_York:20261022T200000
SUMMARY:The Stranger Hour: A Non-Networking Experiment
DESCRIPTION:AVL Digital Nomads\nConfession time: we love our people. Maybe
  a little too much. At every social\, we see the same happy circles\, and 
 we get it. Your friends are great. But somewhere out there tonight is your
  next great friend\, and you haven't met them yet.\n\nSo here's the challe
 nge.\n\n**The Rules**\n\n1. From 6:00 to 7:30\, you can't talk to anyone y
 ou knew before tonight.\n2. Waves are free. Conversations are not.\n3. Cam
 e with a friend? Split up at 6:00 sharp.\n\n**The Stakes:** If you're caug
 ht chatting with someone you already know\, you both owe a beverage (booze
  optional) to whoever called you out. Yes\, your friends will absolutely b
 e watching you.\n\n**The Reunion:** At 7:30\, find your crew and bring at 
 least one new friend with you.\n\nNew to ADN? Congratulations\, you alread
 y know the rules better than anyone. Everyone here is a stranger to someon
 e tonight.\n\nThe game starts at 6:00 on the dot\, so come on time. Will y
 ou accept the challenge?\n\nMasterbbq\, their resident food vendor will be
  serving great food!
URL;VALUE=URI:https://www.meetup.com/avl-digital-nomads/events/316812475/
STATUS:CONFIRMED
CREATED:20261002T133050Z
LAST-MODIFIED:20261002T133050Z
CLASS:PUBLIC
END:VEVENT
