DESCRIPTION:Herb Open Cabin is every wednesday 4-6pm\, come swing by and wo
 rk with and learn about herbs!! \n\nSeptember 30th- Herb harvesting and pr
 ocessing party!\n\nOctober 7th- Plant walk/herb garden educational chat!\n
