SUMMARY:Ecstatic Dance Waves w/ DJ Mikaya (Micah Swabb)
DESCRIPTION:Asheville Movement Collective\nSunday\, November 1st\n1st Danc
 e Wave 8:30\\-10:30am \\| Warmup 8:30am \\| Opening Circle 9am\n2nd Dance 
 Wave 10:30\\-12:30am \\| Warmup 10:30am \\| Opening Circle 11am\nFacilitat
 or DJ Mikaya (Micah Swabb)\n\nIntention: TBA\n\n## About DJ Mikaya\n\nDJ M
 ikaya (Micah Swabb) is a facilitator at AMC and creator of dance waves wit
 h many styles and flavors within the Ecstatic Dance realm. His deejay skil
 l has spanned over two decades covering many ecstatic dance containers\, f
 estivals\, sound healing events and yoga classes. You can listen to his ca
 talog of over 80 mixes and mashups at [http://soundcloud.com/mikayaswabb](
 http://soundcloud.com/mikayaswabb).\n\\~\\~\\~\n\n\\*\\* Please note that 
 the dance starts at Warm up. The doors close promptly at Opening Circle an
 d any that come late will be turned away. Please be on time to ensure a sa
 fe and secure container. \\*\\*\nTicket Prices: $15 - $30 or name your pri
 ce.\n\nNo one turned away for lack of funds!\nPre-registration Recommended
 :\n\nVOLUNTEER!\n\nWe need volunteers. Volunteer and dance for free! Regis
 ter to volunteer at:\n[https://ashevillemovementcollective.org/volunteer/]
 (https://ashevillemovementcollective.org/volunteer/?fbclid=IwZXh0bgNhZW0CM
 TAAYnJpZBExMFZWQ0ZzTmFlam10YUN0RXNydGMGYXBwX2lkEDIyMjAzOTE3ODgyMDA4OTIAAR4
 XGdFINP8qUH1XAETf8I71UKxgUcbNb_LMLwgnJWEzr2I_3ELhDttUv2i1OA_aem_nrjKIXdVB1
 pootRUE4YAfA)\n\nIMPORTANT ANNOUNCEMENTS:\n\nDoor will close at the beginn
 ing of the opening circle. Please note: NO ENTRY AFTER OPENING CIRCLE BOTH
  WAVES!\n\nCollective agreements:\n[https://ashevillemovementcollective.or
 g/our-dance/](https://ashevillemovementcollective.org/our-dance/?fbclid=Iw
 ZXh0bgNhZW0CMTAAYnJpZBExMFZWQ0ZzTmFlam10YUN0RXNydGMGYXBwX2lkEDIyMjAzOTE3OD
 gyMDA4OTIAAR4XGdFINP8qUH1XAETf8I71UKxgUcbNb_LMLwgnJWEzr2I_3ELhDttUv2i1OA_a
 em_nrjKIXdVB1pootRUE4YAfA)\n\nAbout AMC:\nAsheville Movement Collective en
 visions a world that moves in harmony where all are free to be their authe
 ntic selves within a loving community. Our mission and aim are to inspire 
 authenticity and healthy community through free-form dance by hosting danc
 e waves for personal and community transformation. AMC is a 501(c)(3) nonp
 rofit organization.\n\nLocation: 50 Bell Rd\, Asheville\, NC 28805\n\nSee 
 you on the dance floor!
URL;VALUE=URI:https://www.meetup.com/amcdance/events/316746931/
STATUS:CONFIRMED
CREATED:20260928T110200Z
LAST-MODIFIED:20260928T110200Z
CLASS:PUBLIC
END:VEVENT
