DESCRIPTION:Dr. Michael Bitzer\, Director of the Center for North Carolina
  Politics and Public Service\, will join us for an engaging presentation a
 nd conversation about the election outcomes and what they mean for North C
 arolina and the nation. Dr. Bitzer also serves as a Professor of Politics 
 & History at Catawba College and is a published author. In addition\, he i
 s a member of the Commission on the Future of NC Elections and serves as a
 n advisory member to the NC Network for Fair\, Safe and Secure Elections
