 8-5581 by 12 noon the Tuesday before each program.\n\n*Facilities are han
 dicap accessible through the main sanctuary narthex.\n\nPlease arrive by 
 10:30 am.\n\n10:00 to 10:30 Fellowship Time\n\n  * Coffee\, tea\, water\,
  cookies and crackers available for snacking\n  * Magazine\, book & puzzl
 e swap\n  * Blood pressure checks\n\n10:30 to 11:00\n\n  * Announcements\
 n  * Door prizes\n  * Trivia\n  * Chair Exercises\n  * Devotion\n  * Pray
 er Time\n\n11:00 Weekly program\n\n  * May include but not limited to mus
 ical entertainment\, BINGO\, healthy tips about aging\, medical tips\n  *
  Monthly Calendar https://www.mrlec.org/calendar\n\n12:00 Lunch provided\
 n\nWhen Henderson County Public Schools are closed OR on a delay MRLEC wi
 ll NOT meet.
